meta {
  name: management
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  The connector's management API (not DSP; docs/api/management-openapi.json): what the
  operator's own systems call to act as consumer. Its bodies are plain JSON views, not
  DSP messages, and its paths take our consumerPid. Off unless PORTITOR_MANAGEMENT_API_KEY_FILE is set; the
  health checks (liveness, readiness) on the same port are always on and need no key.
  Put the key file's content in the environment's secret apiKey.
}
